<BRK/>
<TXT>Submittals with sensitive data are marked with "(encrypted)" and must be encrypted with NIST FIPS 140-2 compliant 
encryption methods with a password that meets the requirements under paragraph PASSWORDS.  Encrypted submittals 
must be sent via DoD SAFE (https://safe.apps.mil/) and only sent to those who need to know.  If DoD SAFE is not 
available, the government will provide an alternative secure file transfer that must be used. Do not store encrypted 
submittals on shared storage systems.  Store and send encrypted information separately than the password.</TXT><BRK/>
