[<SPT><TTL>Regulatory Requirements</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  If there are regulatory requirements related to a control system, specify 
those in the control system specification.  If there are regulatory requirements 
