      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="87.75">
         <CEL MERGEACROSS="1" STYLEID="s50">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Notes:<BRK/>1)Local Read Only User Interfaces are always Non-Privileged<BRK/>2)Remote Full User Interfaces are always Privileged<BRK/> <BRK/>[3)Device or system should not be capable of providing the interface type, otherwise notify the COR]</DTA>
