</TAI><TAI OPT="DEFAULT REQUIREMENTS"><SPT><TTL>Default Requirements for Other Control Systems</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Do not edit these requirements (beyond selection of bracketed text).  
These default requirements should only be used in lieu of technology-specific 
requirements in the preceding paragraphs.  If these default requirements are 
inappropriate, ensure that the preceding paragraphs provide appropriate technology-specific 
requirements.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>For control system devices where User Interface Requirements are not otherwise indicated in this Section, use 
the Default User Interface Requirements tables.</TXT><BRK/>
