      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="40.50">
         <CEL STYLEID="s51">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Remote Limited, Privileged <BRK/>AND<BRK/>Remote Full (see note 2)</DTA>
         </CEL>
         <CEL STYLEID="s51">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">FULLY</DTA>
         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="84.00">
         <CEL MERGEACROSS="1" STYLEID="s50">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Notes:<BRK/>1)Local Read Only User Interfaces are always Non-Privileged<BRK/>2)Remote Full User Interfaces are always Privileged<BRK/>3)Devices outside mission space require physical security protections as indicated (in "PHYSICAL SECURITY IN MODERATE IMPACT SYSTEMS")</DTA>
